Package: secret-manager
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Maintainer: Hariom Sehgal <hariomsehgal@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/hariomsehgal/secret-manager
Description: End-to-end encrypted secret manager
 Uses XChaCha20-Poly1305 for record encryption, Argon2id for key
 derivation, and HKDF-SHA256 for per-record keys. All crypto runs
 locally — your secrets never leave your machine unencrypted.
 .
 Supports TOTP/MFA, password generation, backup/restore, and
 key sharing. Envelope encryption: Master Password → Argon2id → KEK
 → VEK → DEK → Record ciphertext.
